{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38093","headline":"南安寓止 · 韩偓","name":"南安寓止","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此地三年偶寄家，枳篱茅厂共桑麻。\n蝶矜翅暖徐窥草，蠭倚身轻凝看花。\n天近函关屯瑞气，水侵吴甸浸晴霞。\n岂知卜肆严夫子，潜指星机认海槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}